'''Shampoo (Cat)''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

